    "body": "Bluetooth-based serial ports, where the `connect` and `disconnect` events represent logical connection status  rather than a physical connection, fire a `connect` event on an existing `SerialPort` instance. I think at this point we can consider it an implementation issue that wired serial ports do not have the same behavior.",
